  "solution": "∵ AB∥CD，\n∴∠A=∠ACD=38°，\n∵AB=AE，\n∴∠B=∠AEB=\\(\\frac { 180{}^\\circ -38{}^\\circ } { 2 }\\)=71°，\n∴∠1=180°-∠AEB=180°-71°=109°；\n故答案为109°.",
